<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n67679" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μίδας</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῐ]</span>, gen. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μίδης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εω</span>, ὁ, <u>Midas</u>,
		proverbial for his wealth, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰ . . πλουτοίη . . Μίδεω καὶ Κινύρεω
					μάλιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Tyrt.
					12.6
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
				<u>Epigr.</u>
				3
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐὰν . . πλουτῇ Κινύρα τε καὶ Μίδα
					μᾶλλον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					660e
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>R.</u>
				408b
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὲρ . . τὸν Μίδα πλοῦτον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Merc.Cond.</u>
					20
				</span></i>
			; his ass's ears alluded to in <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pl.</u>
				287
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>the luckiest throw</i> of the dice, which (with the Greeks) was
			when the numbers were all different, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἡρακλῆς</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Eub.
				58
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>a destructive insect in beans</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				4.15.4
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
